>MbhC
anugraham imaṃ manye śyena yan mābhiyācase | tasmāt te 'dya pradāsyāmi svamāṃsaṃ tulayā dhṛtam || 24
>MbhS
anugraham imaṃ manye yan māṃ śyenābhibhāṣase | tasmāt te 'dya pradāsyāmi svamāṃsaṃ tulayā dhṛtam || 25 ||
>VpŚ2
rājā tam abravīd dhṛṣṭo yan me māṃsāni yācase | etad_ yacchāmi te sadyaḥ svamāṃsaṃ tulayā dhṛtam ||
